  "details": "When loading up VRChat, VRChat seems to take full control of your cursor. Forcing you to tab out and back in to regain control. This is particularly frustrating when in Virtual Desktop mode in your VR, Or just plain out trying to do something while loading the game. it doesn't seem to do it when tabbed into the game but always when i have another application such as discord on the foreground of my desktop and my VRChat isn't in focus. This was patched a while back but has since returned.",
